node_modules/
*.vsix
!dist/vscode-md-html-preview.vsix
*.log
.DS_Store

# NOTE: dist/vscode-md-html-preview.vsix is intentionally TRACKED — it is what consumer
# machines install (`code --install-extension`), so they need only git + VS Code, no Node
# or build step. Rebuild it on the dev machine with `dist/release.sh` (or dist/release.ps1).
#
# out/ is also tracked, which predates the .vsix distribution and is no longer required —
# the .vsix carries its own compiled copy. Kept for now so old checkouts keep working.
